# Direct dependencies for the MkDocs documentation site.
#
# `docs/requirements.txt` is the hash-pinned lockfile compiled from this file.
# Never hand-edit the lockfile -- regenerate it instead:
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file=docs/requirements.txt docs/requirements.in
#
# Compile with Python 3.12 to match the version used by .github/workflows/docs.yml.
mkdocs-material
